sequenceDiagram
    participant EC as EntityController
    participant B as OnBeforeMove subscribers
    participant CC as Unity CharacterController
    participant A as OnAfterMove subscriber

    Note over EC,A: Every FixedUpdate, with dt = min(0.02, AdaptedFixedDeltaTime)
    Note right of EC: 1. Apply gravity if airborne
    rect {{phase1}}
        EC->>B: 2. OnBeforeMove
        B->>EC: AddImpulse per axis
        Note right of B: FSM: horizontal velocity<br/>Jump: vertical velocity<br/>Glide: clamps falling speed
    end
    Note right of EC: Push away from walls<br/>if sliding last tick
    EC->>CC: 3. Move(velocity × dt)
    CC-->>EC: Collisions: wall bounce, leftover velocity
    rect {{phase2}}
        EC->>A: 4. OnAfterMove
        Note right of A: PlayerRotation faces<br/>the final velocity.
    end
    Note right of EC: 5. Ground check<br/>SphereCast + slide raycast
    EC-->>B: OnIsGroundedChanged · OnLanded
    Note right of B: Only when the<br/>grounded state changes.
